 / Web Server&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px'&gt;Linux VM · 2 vCPU / 4 GB&lt;br&gt;OS: Ubuntu LTS [Đề xuất]&lt;br&gt;IP: [TBD: DEP-003]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nginx — Reverse Proxy / TLS 1.2+ / HSTS" style="fontFamily=Arial;shape=cube;size=14;darkOpacity=0.05;shadow=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="290" width="240" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dep-v9" value="«artifact»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;spa-dist&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;app.[hash].js · index.html (no-cache)&lt;br&gt;Deploy: /var/www/cwd" style="fontFamily=Arial;shape=note;size=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="dep-v8"><mxGeometry x="15" y="120" width="205" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dep-v10" value="«artifact»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;nginx.conf + TLS cert&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CSP default-src 'self'&lt;br&gt;Deploy: /etc/nginx" style="fontFamily=Arial;shape=note;size=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="dep-v8"><mxGeometry x="15" y="205" width="205" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dep-v11" value="«node»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Application Host&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px'&gt;Linux VM · 8 vCPU / 16 GB · Docker Compose hoặc Kubernetes [TBD: DEP-003]&lt;br&gt;OS: Ubuntu LTS [Đề xuất] · IP: [TBD]&lt;/font&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial;shape=cube;size=14;darkOpacity=0.05;shadow=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="130" width="420" height="700" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dep-v12" value="«container»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;api-1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:9px'&gt;API Service — repl